xt":"たしかにサンプル的側面もありましたね","ts":"1627706143.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/oF0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"411f6374-4b3a-470c-bbc6-9fe669cc5523","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まぁ、ただ、これある種サンプル的な話なのかな？とおもってそのままにしてます","ts":"1627706077.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q5+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6d5f4a5-f3b3-43be-9ea2-cc95b3585016","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"全行一括のほうが速いと思う","ts":"1627706023.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XaO+y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77c8f205-7fef-48af-9ccb-730c70b5003f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"RPCコストは想像以上に大きいという肌感(計測してないのでただの感想)","ts":"1627706011.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=4n="}]},{"client_msg_id":"90c222a1-2f87-420e-995f-2e36fd07fc43","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"正直ないと思います","ts":"1627706010.016200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h9I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90103632-aaa0-43c0-b354-4c7f3b17efcb","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"計測しろで終わる話なんですけど\naroundソースでページごとにバッファの行を取得している部分\n肌感rpcコストに関して全行一括で取得するのに対してページ分けする意義はあると思いますか?","ts":"1627705942.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ndn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d6219a7-7821-4bc9-9086-47dfe5dd17a7","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003c@U7JL1UKKL\u003e\n\nまだ途中ですが、とりあえず\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/16\u003e\n\nあとざっと見て以下の点が気になりましたが PR 範囲外なので放置してます。この辺ついでにやったほうが良いですか？\n\n1. `fn` を使えば `as ...` が不要な場所が多い\n2. ムダに即時関数、それも `async` なものを使っているところが多い\n3. 上記を解消して `batch` にするとかなりパフォーマンス向上に役立ちそうという感想（ちょっとした例として `around` ソースは変えてみました）\nちな、まだ動作確認してないです。諸々終わったら rebase \u0026amp; force push して draft 外します。","ts":"1627704937.014800","thread_ts":"1627704937.014800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/16|#16 Refactoring `sources`\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim/pull/16|#16 Refactoring `sources`\u003e","text":"1. Gather candidates of sources concurrently\n2. Improve performance of `around` source by using `batch`","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/Shougo/ddc.vim|Shougo/ddc.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1627704658}],"reply_count":75,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eAqKc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"357a00c5-d0a2-43ed-aeed-4871746b328c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみに `end_col` に対応しているので、quickfix に `end_col` の情報があればその位置までハイライトされます (なければ行末まで)","ts":"1627704884.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DJxAL"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ありがとうございます！最高！乗り換えました！","ts":"1627704482.010400","files":[{"id":"F029C279W87","created":1627704445,"timestamp":1627704445,"name":"Kapture 2021-07-31 at 13.06.25.mp4","title":"Kapture 2021-07-31 at 13.06.25.mp4","mimetype":"video/mp4","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"mp4","pretty_type":"MPEG 4ビデオ","user":"U78A6ESHM","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":366049,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F029C279W87/kapture_2021-07-31_at_13.06.25.mp4","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F029C279W87/download/kapture_2021-07-31_at_13.06.25.mp4","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_g